For pentesting Web and Mobile applications
    Works by intercepting HTTP/HTTPS traffic for review and routing

Features in the free community edition:
    Proxy
        Interception and modification of requests and responses
    Repeater
        Capture, Modify, and Resend the same request multiple times
    Intruder
        Spraying endpoints with requests. Good for brute forcing
    Decoder
        VData Transformation- Can encode/decode before sending packets to the target
    Comparer
        Comparison of two pieces of data at either the word or byte level
    Sequencer
        Assesses the true randomness of pieces of data, like cookies
    BApp Store
        Store for downloading increased functionality

